title: Legislative Push
subtitle: Move a bill, if we have the votes.
tags: govt_action
new-page: true
view-if: legislation_timer <= 0 and (house_d >= 218 or senate_d >= 51 or white_house == "D")
choose-if: capital >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: We need at least 3 capital.
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; capital -= 3; legislation_timer = 2

= Legislative Push

Congress is where majorities are made real. What do we bring to the floor?

- @healthcare: Defend and extend health coverage.
- @voting: Voting rights and election protection.
- @economy: Economic relief and investment.
- @climate: Clean energy and climate.
- @policing: Police and criminal-justice reform.
- @border: A bipartisan immigration and border package.

@healthcare
subtitle: Locks in a core achievement.
view-if: aca_secured = 0 or year >= 2017
on-arrival: aca_secured = 1; enthusiasm += 3; pop_mod += 0.3; mod_dissent += 1; estab_dissent -= 2

Insurance for tens of millions is a hard thing to repeal once people have it.

@voting
subtitle: Protects the franchise. Hard to pass without 60 votes or a rules change.
on-arrival: voting_rights = 1; stability += 6; enthusiasm += 3; unity += 2; far_right += 1; capital -= 1 if senate_d < 60

We either find the votes, or we find out why we cannot.

@economy
subtitle: Relief and investment.
on-arrival: pop_mod += 0.5; enthusiasm += 2; mod_dissent += 2; labor_dissent -= 4; stability += 1

The checks reach people. So do the price tags.

@climate
subtitle: A long-run priority for the left and the young.
on-arrival: climate_law = 1; pop_mod += 0.1; enthusiasm += 4; prog_dissent -= 5; mod_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 1

Tax credits, grants, and a durable investment framework.

@policing
subtitle: Reform has real political costs.
on-arrival: police_reform = 1; enthusiasm += 3; prog_dissent -= 3; mod_dissent += 4; pop_mod -= 0.1; stability += 1

The reform is real and the backlash is also real.

@border
subtitle: Politically costly with the base, and potentially with the right.
on-arrival: immigration_deal = 1; pop_mod += 0.2; prog_dissent += 6; mod_dissent -= 4; far_right -= 2; unity -= 2

A deal like this is hard to get and harder to defend.
